<section class="page-hero page-hero--compact"><div class="container narrow"><span class="eyebrow">Legal</span><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>Last updated August 31, 2026</p></div></section><section class="section section--light"><div class="container prose"><h2>Information we process</h2><p>We process account and profile information supplied to administrators, basic security logs, session cookies, and information voluntarily provided in reports. Public profiles intentionally expose only approved directory information.</p><h2>Why we process it</h2><p>Information is used to operate, secure, moderate, and improve the directory; respond to rights requests; prevent abuse; and comply with law. We do not sell personal information.</p><h2>Service providers and retention</h2><p>MongoDB stores application records and Cloudinary stores uploaded images. Data is retained only as needed for directory operation, moderation, security, and legal obligations. Soft-deleted profiles remain recoverable by administrators until permanently removed under the retention process.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may request access, correction, unpublishing, or deletion by contacting the privacy address on our contact page. Reports should not include more personal information than necessary.</p><h2>Cookies</h2><p>We use essential session cookies for security and administrator authentication. The age confirmation preference is stored in your browser.</p></div></section>
